        "@value": "Donate Now &#8226; Cecilia Concerts | Halifax, Nova Scotia"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "As we celebrate the successful conclusion of our 35th season of Main Stage Concerts and close in on the end of the 3rd season of our popular free Sensory-Accessible Concerts series, we reflect on an incredible year filled with captivating live chamber music performances. Featuring more than 50 phenomenal musicians from both near and far, it has been our joy to bring some of the world to Halifax stages while also supporting local musicians. We owe this year’s success to our wonderful audiences, dedicated artists, tireless volunteers, collaborative partners, and bighearted donors. Thank you all for your support!"
      }
