        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\t\n\nEN\nFR \nContact Us\nCecilia Concerts\n6199 Chebucto Road\nK'jipuktuk/Halifax\nMi’kma’ki/Nova Scotia\nB3L 1K7\n902 423 0143\nJules Chamberlain\nArtistic Director\n[email protected]\nGregory Morris\nExecutive Director\n[email protected]\nAbbey Frias\nAdministrator\n[email protected]\nPlease use the form below to contact us:\n\n\nNous contacter\nConcerts Cecilia\n6199, chemin Chebucto\nK'jipuktuk/Halifax\nMi'kma'ki/Nouvelle-Écosse\nB3L 1K7\n902 423 0143\nJules Chamberlain\nDirecteur artistique\n[email protected]\nGregory Morris\nDirecteur exécutif\n[email protected]\nAbbey Frias\nAdministratrice\n[email protected]\nVeuillez utiliser le formulaire ci-dessous pour nous contacter :\n\n\n\n\n\n\nContact Us\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Name\n        *\n    \n    \n    First\n    \n\n\n    Last\n        *\n    \n    \n    Last\n    \n\n\n    Email\n        *\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n    Telephone\n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n    Message\n        *\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n    Would You Like to Sign-Up for our OPUS Newsletter?\n        \n    \n    \t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t Yes, Please Sign Me Up!\n\n    \n    \n\n\n    Captcha\n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tIf you are human, leave this field blank.\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t"
      }
