    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Spotlight Full Concert Package&lt;br&gt;Save 25% Off"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "EN\nFR \nSpotlight Full Subscription Package\nSecure your seats today with our Spotlight Subscription Package, which includes tickets to all of the remaining Main Stage Concerts in our 2025/26 season, plus a 25% discount on ticket prices.\nBooking is simple, simply select your subscription package below. You’ll receive an electronic confirmation immediately after placing your order, followed by your tickets via email within 48 hours. We look forward to welcoming you to the performances!\n\n\n\nForfait d'abonnement complet Spotlight\nRéservez vos places dès aujourd'hui grâce à notre Spotlight Subscription Package, qui comprend des billets pour tous les concerts restants de la saison 2025/26 sur la scène principale, ainsi qu'une réduction de 25 % sur le prix des billets.\nLa réservation est simple, il vous suffit de sélectionner votre forfait d'abonnement ci-dessous. Vous recevrez une confirmation électronique immédiatement après avoir passé votre commande, puis vos billets par e-mail dans les 48 heures. Nous sommes impatients de vous accueillir aux spectacles !\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tSelect Package \n\t\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t\t Choose an optionGeneralUnder 30GeneralUnder 30Clear selection\n                    \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t        \t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\tSpotlight Full Concert PackageSave 25% Off quantity\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tSELECT QTY &amp;amp; CLICK HERE\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tYour package includes one set of tickets for each of the following performances:(All concerts take place at the Stage at St. Andrews, 6036 Coburg Road in Halifax)\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tIllia Ovcharenko • Saturday, November 15, 2025 \t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tTrio Uchida-Crozman-Chiu • Saturday, December 6, 2025\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tTrio Seoul : East Meets West • Saturday, January 10, 2026\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tMark Fewer &amp; Mathieu Gaudet • Saturday, January 24, 2026 • 7:30pm\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tChristian Paquette &amp; Steve Cowan • Saturday, February 21, 2026 • 7:30pm\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tThalea String Quartet: Something Golden • Saturday, March 7, 2026 • 7:30pm\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tCharles Yang &amp; Peter Dugan • Saturday, March 14, 2026 • 7:30pm\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tIdentity: A Song Cycle • Saturday, March 28, 2026 • 7:30pm\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tCharlotte Thiele, Bryan Cheng, &amp; Silvie Cheng: Legacy • Saturday, April 11, 2026 • 7:30pm\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tIsidore Quartet: Brahms - The Admirer • Saturday, April 25, 2026 • 7:30pm\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tBryan Cheng and Balourdet Quartet: heartSTRINGS!  Saturday, May 9, 2026 • 7:30pm\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t*REQUIREDSelect Package\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\tChoose an optionGeneralUnder 30\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\tReset options"
      }
    ]
