        "@value": "We invite our community to launch the giving season by supporting the Cecilia Concerts Developing Musician Award. This award recognizes an outstanding young musician in Nova Scotia and provides a fully supported professional recital, a generous bursary toward musical studies, professional headshots, and a high-quality concert video for portfolio and grant use. Your support helps a promising artist take an important step forward in their musical development."
      }
