        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\t\t\t\t\n\nEN\nFR \nTickets & Packages\nIndividual Ticket Prices\nOur regular Main Stage Concerts series ticket prices are:\nUnder 30 (30 Years and Under) – $30.00 + HST\nGeneral Admission (Adult and Senior) – $42.00 + HST\nPlease note that tickets for special presentations may vary in price.\nSubscription Packages\n\n\t\tSale!Spotlight Full Concert PackageSave 25% Off\n\t$247.50 – $346.50Price range: $247.50 through $346.50\nMORE INFORMATION • GET TICKETS\t\n\t\tThis product has multiple variants. The options may be chosen on the product page\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t(window.wpmDataLayer = window.wpmDataLayer || {}).products                = window.wpmDataLayer.products || {};\n\t\t\twindow.wpmDataLayer.products[37573] = {\"id\":\"37573\",\"sku\":\"\",\"price\":282.1499999999999772626324556767940521240234375,\"brand\":\"\",\"quantity\":1,\"dyn_r_ids\":{\"post_id\":\"37573\",\"sku\":37573,\"gpf\":\"woocommerce_gpf_37573\",\"gla\":\"gla_37573\"},\"is_variable\":true,\"type\":\"variable\",\"name\":\"Spotlight Full Concert Package<br>Save 25% Off\",\"category\":[\"202526\",\"Package\"],\"is_variation\":false};\n\t\t\t\t\twindow.pmw_product_position = window.pmw_product_position || 1;\n\t\twindow.wpmDataLayer.products[37573]['position'] = window.pmw_product_position++;\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\tSale!Ovation 8 Concert PackageSave 20% Off\n\t$192.00 – $268.80Price range: $192.00 through $268.80\nMORE INFORMATION • GET TICKETS\t\n\t\tThis product has multiple variants. The options may be chosen on the product page\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t(window.wpmDataLayer = window.wpmDataLayer || {}).products                = window.wpmDataLayer.products || {};\n\t\t\twindow.wpmDataLayer.products[37151] = {\"id\":\"37151\",\"sku\":\"\",\"price\":218.8799999999999954525264911353588104248046875,\"brand\":\"\",\"quantity\":1,\"dyn_r_ids\":{\"post_id\":\"37151\",\"sku\":37151,\"gpf\":\"woocommerce_gpf_37151\",\"gla\":\"gla_37151\"},\"is_variable\":true,\"type\":\"variable\",\"name\":\"Ovation 8 Concert Package<br>Save 20% Off\",\"category\":[\"202526\",\"Package\"],\"is_variation\":false};\n\t\t\t\t\twindow.pmw_product_position = window.pmw_product_position || 1;\n\t\twindow.wpmDataLayer.products[37151]['position'] = window.pmw_product_position++;\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\tSale!Applause 5 Concert PackageSave 15% Off\n\t$127.50 – $178.50Price range: $127.50 through $178.50\nMORE INFORMATION • GET TICKETS\t\n\t\tThis product has multiple variants. The options may be chosen on the product page\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t(window.wpmDataLayer = window.wpmDataLayer || {}).products                = window.wpmDataLayer.products || {};\n\t\t\twindow.wpmDataLayer.products[37146] = {\"id\":\"37146\",\"sku\":\"\",\"price\":145.349999999999994315658113919198513031005859375,\"brand\":\"\",\"quantity\":1,\"dyn_r_ids\":{\"post_id\":\"37146\",\"sku\":37146,\"gpf\":\"woocommerce_gpf_37146\",\"gla\":\"gla_37146\"},\"is_variable\":true,\"type\":\"variable\",\"name\":\"Applause 5 Concert Package<br>Save 15% Off\",\"category\":[\"202526\",\"Package\"],\"is_variation\":false};\n\t\t\t\t\twindow.pmw_product_position = window.pmw_product_position || 1;\n\t\twindow.wpmDataLayer.products[37146]['position'] = window.pmw_product_position++;\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\tSale!Encore 3 Concert PackageSave 10% Off\n\t$81.00 – $113.40Price range: $81.00 through $113.40\nMORE INFORMATION • GET TICKETS\t\n\t\tThis product has multiple variants. The options may be chosen on the product page\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t(window.wpmDataLayer = window.wpmDataLayer || {}).products                = window.wpmDataLayer.products || {};\n\t\t\twindow.wpmDataLayer.products[12863] = {\"id\":\"12863\",\"sku\":\"\",\"price\":92.340000000000003410605131648480892181396484375,\"brand\":\"\",\"quantity\":1,\"dyn_r_ids\":{\"post_id\":\"12863\",\"sku\":12863,\"gpf\":\"woocommerce_gpf_12863\",\"gla\":\"gla_12863\"},\"is_variable\":true,\"type\":\"variable\",\"name\":\"Encore 3 Concert Package<br>Save 10% Off\",\"category\":[\"202526\",\"Package\"],\"is_variation\":false};\n\t\t\t\t\twindow.pmw_product_position = window.pmw_product_position || 1;\n\t\twindow.wpmDataLayer.products[12863]['position'] = window.pmw_product_position++;\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\nCommunity Tickets\nWe believe that everyone should have access to music. If you are unable to afford a full-price concert ticket, we encourage you to contact us for a community ticketing discount.\nAs a not-for-profit charity organization, ticket sales cover only a fraction of our concert costs. If you can afford a full-price ticket, please consider purchasing one, allowing the discounted tickets to go to those who truly need them.\nTo request a community ticket, please contact us at: [email protected]\n\nGeneral Ticketing Policy\n\nTickets and events are subject to change, postponement, or cancellation at any time; if this occurs, ticket holders will be notified of a rescheduled concert date as soon as possible or credited with a ticket to a future concert of equal or lesser value of the holder’s choice. We are also happy to refund your purchase or exchange your tickets for a charitable donation tax receipt of equal value. Please contact our office to make arrangements.\n\nStorm Information\n\nIn the event of an impending or occurring storm that may impact a performance, ticket holders are advised to call the Cecilia Concerts office at 902-423-0143 for a pre-recorded concert update. Ticket holders may also visit our website and social media profiles for information.\n\n\nBillets et forfaits\nPrix des billets individuels\nLes prix des billets de notre série Main Stage Concerts sont les suivants :\nMoins de 30 ans (30 ans et moins) - 30,00 $ + TVH\nAdmission générale (adultes et personnes âgées) - 42,00 $ + TVH\nVeuillez noter que le prix des billets pour les présentations spéciales peut varier.\nPaquets d'abonnements\n\n\t\tSale!Spotlight Full Concert PackageSave 25% Off\n\t$247.50 – $346.50Price range: $247.50 through $346.50\nMORE INFORMATION • GET TICKETS\t\n\t\tThis product has multiple variants. The options may be chosen on the product page\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t(window.wpmDataLayer = window.wpmDataLayer || {}).products                = window.wpmDataLayer.products || {};\n\t\t\twindow.wpmDataLayer.products[37573] = {\"id\":\"37573\",\"sku\":\"\",\"price\":282.1499999999999772626324556767940521240234375,\"brand\":\"\",\"quantity\":1,\"dyn_r_ids\":{\"post_id\":\"37573\",\"sku\":37573,\"gpf\":\"woocommerce_gpf_37573\",\"gla\":\"gla_37573\"},\"is_variable\":true,\"type\":\"variable\",\"name\":\"Spotlight Full Concert Package<br>Save 25% Off\",\"category\":[\"202526\",\"Package\"],\"is_variation\":false};\n\t\t\t\t\twindow.pmw_product_position = window.pmw_product_position || 1;\n\t\twindow.wpmDataLayer.products[37573]['position'] = window.pmw_product_position++;\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\tSale!Ovation 8 Concert PackageSave 20% Off\n\t$192.00 – $268.80Price range: $192.00 through $268.80\nMORE INFORMATION • GET TICKETS\t\n\t\tThis product has multiple variants. The options may be chosen on the product page\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t(window.wpmDataLayer = window.wpmDataLayer || {}).products                = window.wpmDataLayer.products || {};\n\t\t\twindow.wpmDataLayer.products[37151] = {\"id\":\"37151\",\"sku\":\"\",\"price\":218.8799999999999954525264911353588104248046875,\"brand\":\"\",\"quantity\":1,\"dyn_r_ids\":{\"post_id\":\"37151\",\"sku\":37151,\"gpf\":\"woocommerce_gpf_37151\",\"gla\":\"gla_37151\"},\"is_variable\":true,\"type\":\"variable\",\"name\":\"Ovation 8 Concert Package<br>Save 20% Off\",\"category\":[\"202526\",\"Package\"],\"is_variation\":false};\n\t\t\t\t\twindow.pmw_product_position = window.pmw_product_position || 1;\n\t\twindow.wpmDataLayer.products[37151]['position'] = window.pmw_product_position++;\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\tSale!Applause 5 Concert PackageSave 15% Off\n\t$127.50 – $178.50Price range: $127.50 through $178.50\nMORE INFORMATION • GET TICKETS\t\n\t\tThis product has multiple variants. The options may be chosen on the product page\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t(window.wpmDataLayer = window.wpmDataLayer || {}).products                = window.wpmDataLayer.products || {};\n\t\t\twindow.wpmDataLayer.products[37146] = {\"id\":\"37146\",\"sku\":\"\",\"price\":145.349999999999994315658113919198513031005859375,\"brand\":\"\",\"quantity\":1,\"dyn_r_ids\":{\"post_id\":\"37146\",\"sku\":37146,\"gpf\":\"woocommerce_gpf_37146\",\"gla\":\"gla_37146\"},\"is_variable\":true,\"type\":\"variable\",\"name\":\"Applause 5 Concert Package<br>Save 15% Off\",\"category\":[\"202526\",\"Package\"],\"is_variation\":false};\n\t\t\t\t\twindow.pmw_product_position = window.pmw_product_position || 1;\n\t\twindow.wpmDataLayer.products[37146]['position'] = window.pmw_product_position++;\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\tSale!Encore 3 Concert PackageSave 10% Off\n\t$81.00 – $113.40Price range: $81.00 through $113.40\nMORE INFORMATION • GET TICKETS\t\n\t\tThis product has multiple variants. The options may be chosen on the product page\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t(window.wpmDataLayer = window.wpmDataLayer || {}).products                = window.wpmDataLayer.products || {};\n\t\t\twindow.wpmDataLayer.products[12863] = {\"id\":\"12863\",\"sku\":\"\",\"price\":92.340000000000003410605131648480892181396484375,\"brand\":\"\",\"quantity\":1,\"dyn_r_ids\":{\"post_id\":\"12863\",\"sku\":12863,\"gpf\":\"woocommerce_gpf_12863\",\"gla\":\"gla_12863\"},\"is_variable\":true,\"type\":\"variable\",\"name\":\"Encore 3 Concert Package<br>Save 10% Off\",\"category\":[\"202526\",\"Package\"],\"is_variation\":false};\n\t\t\t\t\twindow.pmw_product_position = window.pmw_product_position || 1;\n\t\twindow.wpmDataLayer.products[12863]['position'] = window.pmw_product_position++;\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\nBillets pour la communauté\nNous pensons que tout le monde devrait avoir accès à la musique. Si vous n'avez pas les moyens d'acheter un billet de concert à plein tarif, nous vous encourageons à nous contacter pour bénéficier d'une réduction sur les billets communautaires.\nEn tant qu'organisation caritative à but non lucratif, la vente de billets ne couvre qu'une partie des coûts de nos concerts. Si vous avez les moyens d'acheter un billet plein tarif, nous vous invitons à le faire, ce qui permettra aux personnes qui en ont vraiment besoin de bénéficier des billets à prix réduit.\nPour demander un billet communautaire, veuillez nous contacter à l'adresse suivante : [email protected]\n\nPolitique générale de billetterie\n\nLes billets et les événements sont susceptibles d'être modifiés, reportés ou annulés à tout moment. Dans ce cas, les détenteurs de billets seront informés dès que possible de la date d'un nouveau concert ou recevront un billet pour un futur concert de valeur égale ou inférieure, au choix du détenteur. Nous sommes également heureux de rembourser votre achat ou d'échanger vos billets contre un reçu fiscal pour don de charité d'une valeur équivalente. Veuillez contacter notre bureau pour prendre les dispositions nécessaires.\n\nInformations sur les tempêtes\n\nEn cas de tempête imminente ou en cours qui pourrait avoir un impact sur une représentation, il est conseillé aux détenteurs de billets d'appeler le bureau des Concerts Cecilia au 902-423-0143 pour obtenir une mise à jour préenregistrée sur le concert. Les détenteurs de billets peuvent également consulter notre site web et nos profils de médias sociaux pour obtenir des informations.\n\n\n\t\t\t"
      }
